    <h2 id="dry-shampoos">Aerosol Dry Shampoos and Cleansing Sprays</h2>
    <p>Aerosol shampoos, commonly referred to as dry shampoos, are formulated to absorb excess oil, refresh hair appearance, and improve manageability without water. These systems rely on absorbent powders, surface modifiers, and volatile carriers that evaporate after application.</p>
    <p>The aerosol format ensures even powder dispersion across the scalp and hair roots, minimizing localized buildup and improving cosmetic finish. Spray force and droplet dynamics are essential to prevent visible residue and ensure consumer satisfaction.</p>

    <table>
    <tr><th>Functional Objectives</th></tr>
    <tr><td>Sebum absorption and scalp refresh</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Improved hair volume and texture</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Convenience for water-free grooming</td></tr>
    </table>

    <h2 id="shine-sprays">Hair Shine and Gloss Aerosol Sprays</h2>
    <p>Hair shine sprays are designed to enhance optical reflectivity and smooth the hair surface, creating a polished and healthy appearance. These systems deposit lightweight conditioning agents and gloss enhancers that modify surface roughness and light reflection behavior of hair fibers.</p>
    <p>Aerosol delivery ensures fine deposition without weighing down the hair or creating greasy buildup. Shine spray performance is closely linked to spray pattern uniformity, solvent evaporation control, and residue transparency.</p>

    <table>
    <tr><th>Primary Roles</th></tr>
    <tr><td>Enhancing hair gloss and visual smoothness</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Reducing frizz and surface irregularities</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Improving final styling aesthetics</td></tr>
    </table>

    
