  <h2>Market Relevance: India and Global Perspective</h2>
  <p>The cosmetic aerosol industry represents a rapidly expanding market globally and in India, driven by high demand for styling products, temporary coloring systems, and dry shampoos. Formulating these hair care products requires balancing volatile solvents, active polymers, and gassing pressures to meet consumer expectations for spray pattern and hold. Developers must also navigate regional propellant regulations and safety limits.</p>
  <p>In India and global markets, aerosol hair products are driven by urbanization, grooming awareness, salon influence, and premium personal care trends. Startups and entrepreneurs entering this space must understand aerosol science, compliance, and performance expectations before commercialization.</p>
    <p>Aerosol hair products offer scalability, private-label opportunities, and global export potential when developed with strong technical foundations.</p>
</section>

